/T (  Placing External Calls  To make a telephonecall,simply entertheextension number or telephone number of your destination and press OK or Off-hook key.  Placing multiple External Calls  When you are in an active call you can put your call on hold and then place a new call. 1. Select New Call  2. Enter the extension number or telephone number and then press the OK key.   )
/E (  Placing External Calls  To make a telephonecall,simply entertheextension number or telephone number of your destination and press OK or Off-hook key.  Placing multiple External Calls  When you are in an active call you can put your call on hold and then place a new call. 1. Select New Call  2. Enter the extension number or telephone number and then press the OK key.   )
/Pg 16 0 R
