/T (  Silent Mode  You can enable the silent mode if you do not want to be disturbed. The handset will not ring when receiving an incoming call, but it will still display the incoming call information. Simply long press the * button until the phone displays "All Ring Tones Off". To turn silent mode off, simply long press the * button again until the phone display "All Ring Tones On". )
/E (  Silent Mode  You can enable the silent mode if you do not want to be disturbed. The handset will not ring when receiving an incoming call, but it will still display the incoming call information. Simply long press the * button until the phone displays "All Ring Tones Off". To turn silent mode off, simply long press the * button again until the phone display "All Ring Tones On". )
